  "all_ingredients_flat": "mustard seeds, onion, ginger, garlic, green chillies, coriander, cumin powder, garam masala, hing (asafetida), haldi (turmeric powder), tomato, tamarind paste, coconut sugar, white peas, cilantro, potatoes, salt, corn starch, green chutney, tamarind date chutney",
  "instructions": "DRIED PEAS CURRY: Saut\u00e9 mustard seeds. Add onion, ginger, garlic, green chillies. Saut\u00e9 till brown. Add coriander, cumin powder, garam masala, hing (asafetida), haldi (turmeric powder). Saut\u00e9 for 1 min. Add 1 tomato, tamarind paste, 1 Tbsp coconut sugar. Add white peas and cook for 7 minutes. Add cilantro. POTATO PATTIES: Mash together potatoes, ginger, garlic, salt and 1 Tbsp corn starch. Shape into patties and air fry at 350F for 15 mins. Flip and fry for 5 mins.",
